    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19388.png",
      "text": "'M'e oa Mojalefa a kopa Mojalefa hoea shopong. \"Tsamaea o ee shopong ea Ntate Ramosebetsi o loreka nama ea khoho. Retla eja bosiu.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:4d0849b8b2d606f928624b549fc6d0afc4f9006c42a4cba0d4036822110067a6"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19389.png",
      "text": "Eaba 'M'e oa Mojalefa ofa Mojalefa M50. Mojalefa aee ts'ela ka pokothong ea hae ea bolikhoe.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:898eb30f2053af71dd72424998bc3bb5064e3b158dc9ecdc994ffef337266931"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19390.png",
      "text": "Mojalefa a tsamaea a feta ha 'M'e Malekau. A tsamaea a feta ts'imong ea Ntate Pitso. A feta ha 'M'e Mampho. O ne antse a hlatsoa liphahlo tsa hae lebaleng.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:d4dc5961595f1a50325a979adcc809be5f0d22400ed2e5e89c72a64cbc9750cd"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19391.png",
      "text": "Hoea ha Ntate Ramosebetsi e ne e le tsela e telehele haholo. Mojalefa o ne a tsamaea butle haholo. A kenya letsoho ka pokothong ea hae. M50 ene ele ka mono.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:05ce72fb5190dc2cf8968d4daa3b89ce87d93b1a7d0155c25392fcf762611ebd"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19392.png",
      "text": "Empa aaah, hone hoena le ntho engoe ka pokothong ea hae. Ene ele pompong. Mojalefa a re, \"Mmmm. Pompong ena etla nthusa ho tsamae tsela ena e telehele hantle.\" Eaba o akhela pompong ena ka lehanong la hae. \"Mmmm, pompong ena kannete e monate!\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1ec8c8dfad68c2ab573da2e17331e1b1312cd703063880d37463727adbade344"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19393.png",
      "text": "A tsamaea kapele. A fihla ha Ntate Ramosebetsi shopong kapele. A fumana nama ea khoho. Alo e patalla.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6b77aaa4eeb59985f476bf5d8baaf366efb450b1eb3bc8e1bfc967b6ebbc072a"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19394.png",
      "text": "A kenya letsoho ka pokothong ea hae. A fumana M50 e le siko! A sheba ka pokothong engoe. A fumana M50 e le siko.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:fc7df12c9a2d1da98571951e4b8fa03c5c442c6c28219e0dc69f020d3d9dea34"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19395.png",
      "text": "Mojalefa a ferekana haholo. Atsoa ka shopong a matha. O ne a sa tsebe a ka etsa joang. A tlameha ke khutlele hae a sa nka nama ea khoho. Ahla a tseba hore 'M'e oa hae otlo koata.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8df0ea413f245ac0c4c80522340626ed49cd1697014c71ced5d2eb9b46c3fc15"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19396.png",
      "text": "Antse a tsamaea butle. A kamaka hohle fats'e. A bona 'M'e Mampho. O ne antse a hlatsoa liphahlo tsa hae.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:1607f39f0a815b9a44b84b6add2fb6e22c85972ee8aa1ce849ba77e59094fc5d"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19397.png",
      "text": "'M'e Mampho a botsa, \"Hobaneng Mojalefa o shebahala o koatile?\" \"Ke lahlile chelete ea 'M'e oaka. A re, \"'M'e oaka otlo koata.\" 'M'e Mampho a re, \"Ha o ka shebisisa hantle, kena le bonnete otla e fumana.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:5996c925269d2fc3b8ee03946f1c84b10070ed937f15a04b4f23f52f1d51d922"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19398.png",
      "text": "Mojalefa a tsamaea hape. A kamaka hohle fats'e. Eaba o bona pampiri e nyane e pinki. Ke ena. E ne e le M50 ea 'M'e oa hae!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a409bb1b7a027c7c8c9e590b2ea0dc52792810e4440a30c1d051aee683ff3f6c"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/19399.png",
      "text": "Mojalefa ae thoanaka. \"'M'e Mampho! Ke efumane,\" ke Mojalefa eoo. A matha ho khutle shopong ea Ntate Ramosebetsi. O ne a thabile haholo. Hona joale a rekela 'M'e oa hae nama ea khoho. Ha o ne o le Mojalefa, o ne o ka ikutloa joang?",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=1&dual=false&id=19471#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:0deed4f7f09abe1db8758eb5eebf20774fb61a80a7437a9c1a32830be60a413e"
    }
  ],
